    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"letting yourself rest\"... it sounds almost poetic when you put it that way. but staying on the shore just feels like waiting for something that's never coming back. i look at the sunset and i don't feel peace, i just feel like the day is over and it's not coming back. i wonder if there's a difference between just resting and... you know, just letting the tide take you out so you don't have to feel so heavy anymore.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
